_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 14
---
order: 14
---
short_label: V.14
---
statement: If a first magnitude has to a second the same ratio as a third has to a fourth, and the first is greater than the third, then the second is also greater than the fourth; if equal, equal; and if less, less.
---
proof:

Let a first magnitude *A* have the same ratio to a second *B* as a third *C* has to a fourth *D,* and let *A* be greater than *C.*

I say that *B* is also greater than *D.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="300" height="120" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="V.14 diagram" src="propV14.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
